ositionsManaging the autopilot system, including in case of failure; recognize and recover from abnormal flight status. The number of training exercises on simulators or on aircraft is determined by the aircraft operator in the training and testing program but must not be less than 05 training exercises, excluding training exercises for special forms of operations, air-time training and competency assessment tests.
