Article 947. Maximum flight time and duty time
1. Maximum flight time and duty time are specified as follows:
a) 2000 hours of duty in a calendar year;
b) 190 hours of duty over 28 consecutive days, distributed as evenly as possible throughout this period;
c) 60 hours of duty in 7 consecutive days;
d) 14 hours of duty in 01 day;
d) 1000 flight hours in a calendar year;
e) 1000 flight hours in 12 consecutive months;
g) 100 flight hours in a period of 28 consecutive days;
h) 09 flight hours in 01 day (may be limited by maximum allowable FDP).
2. Changes in flight duty time and maximum flight time are specified as follows:
