2. Provide a formal process for managing change that requires including but not limited to the following:
a) Identification of changes in the operating environment that may affect the FRMS;
b) Identification of changes within the organization that may affect the FRMS;
c) Consider available tools that can be used to maintain and improve FRMS performance before making changes.
3. Provide continuous improvements of FRMS, including:
