b) For flights without carry-on baggage or carry-on baggage calculated separately, aircraft operators can reduce the standard weight value of men and women by 06 kg. Personal items such as coats, umbrellas, small handbags, makeup bags, reading books or small cameras are not counted as carry-on baggage to apply the provisions of this Clause.","translations":{"en":"Article 997. Determine weight according to standard value table

