i) Task assignment, cockpit coordination, cross-supervision, workload management and flight crew resource management in performance-based navigation operations.
2. For RNP APCH, RNP AR APCH, RNP AR DP, RNP 0.3 for helicopters or operations using RF flight functions, the aircraft operator is responsible for ensuring that flight crew members receive practical training on simulators or on aircraft in accordance with the characteristics of the method, navigation system and operating conditions.
