h) The flight dispatch coordination process stipulates the coordination responsibilities between flight crew members, flight dispatch staff and flight operations control personnel in the process of planning, monitoring and handling changes in EDTO flights.
3. Aircraft operators are responsible for ensuring that the EDTO operation process clearly defines the responsibilities of flight crew members, flight dispatchers, flight operations control personnel and relevant departments in each stage of the EDTO flight.
